OL,3,GNEWSAKing Charles says he's 'privileged
OL,4,Aand proud' to have special connection
OL,5,Awith Wales at opening of Senedd
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III and Queen Camilla have
OL,8,Fofficially opened the new term of the
OL,9,FSenedd, Wales' parliament, in Cardiff
OL,11,FThe King took part in the ceremony for
OL,12,Fthe first time since becoming monarch
OL,14,FIt is also the first opening of a
OL,15,FSenedd term since Plaid Cymru became
OL,16,FWales' largest party and took over the
OL,17,Frunning of its government
OL,19,FChants of "not my King" heard as the
OL,20,FRoyal car arrived, and police arrest
OL,21,Fone protester
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
